ter skills; B can be grumpy, uncooperative. Compare to others: C 100% reliable but communication difficulty; D takes responsibility but arrogant; A leadership but unorganized.\n\nThus vote for B.\n\nNow produce PUBLIC_MESSAGE and METADATA_JSON."}
